{
  "surface": "packages/plugin-api/view.js#createViewBridge runtime.settings runtime.textSize",
  "description": "Ordered steps of the settings and text size calls of a view page: a read step calls runtime.settings.read or runtime.textSize.read and the answer is the reply, a subscribe step calls the on of settings or textSize with a named listener (listener null calls it without a listener), and an event step delivers a host event {event, data} to the listeners of its name. Each step lists the messages the page posts, the listener calls in order as {listener, data}, the result (a read gives its value, a subscribe gives function, and null when it applies), and the text of the error the step raises. The page is sok://probe/. settings has no key argument: runtime.settings.read returns the values of the plugin, and each host change is delivered to every listener of settings.",
